  "enchant": {
    "_comment": "Enchantments (efsun), Metin2 style. Imbue adds one bonus with imbue_chance[current count] percent (a failure still uses the scroll); reweave rerolls every bonus keeping the count. A bonus rolls a stat from the pool of the item's slot kind (slot_kinds; never a stat the item already has, never one of the item's own fixed stats) and a grade by grade_weights; value = values[grade]. `disabled` stats stay listed in the pools but are not rolled until their mechanic ships. `legacy` stats are no longer rolled but keep working on items that carry them. `flag` stats are on/off (any value > 0). Units: % is percent, /s points per second, plain numbers are flat. Every stat has a `theme` (attack, mind, hunt, control, guard, vitality, fortune, travel); slot_themes lists the themes a piece may roll, so a pool entry outside them never rolls (boots never roll attack speed or crit, only guard / mind / vitality / fortune). families maps a creature family (mobs.json) to its 'strong against' stat.",
