  "critical": {
    "_comment": "Every player hit rolls a critical: base_chance + the attacker's enchanted crit_chance, plus finisher_bonus on the last hit of the basic combo chain (all percent, capped at max_chance). A crit deals multiplier x damage. Creatures never crit.",
    "base_chance": 5.0,
    "finisher_bonus": 15.0,
    "max_chance": 60.0,
    "multiplier": 1.75
  },
  "item_stats": {
    "_comment": "Fixed item stats (items.json) and the Metin2-style hit rules. Damage: basic_cast adds a roll of the wand's attack_value, every other spell adds a roll of magic_attack x the spell's magic_attack_coef (spells.json); the sum scales with the +N multiplier, house and skill, then spell_power, family bonus, crit/pierce. Armour: reduction = armor / (armor + armor_base + armor_per_level x attacker level), capped; after it the matching melee/projectile/spell resistance (by mob_attack_kinds; unknown ids are spells), capped. Speeds: attack_speed shortens the basic_cast cooldown (/ (1 + pct)), cast_speed every other cooldown (x (1 - pct)), move_speed scales walking only. Piercing ignores the creature's resistances and front guard.",
    "armor_base": 100,
    "armor_per_level": 8,
    "armor_max_reduction": 75,
    "resist_cap": 50,
    "attack_speed_cap": 100,
    "cast_speed_cap": 40,
    "move_speed_min": -20,
    "move_speed_max": 40,
    "block_cap": 50,
    "dodge_cap": 50,
    "reflect_cap": 30,
    "life_steal_cap": 20,
